This repository contains an experimental, reduced-width LIN port of the
Uniswap V3 TickMath.getSqrtRatioAtTick algorithm published in
Uniswap/v3-core v1.0.0 (GPL-2.0-or-later after BUSL Change Date 2023-04-01).

Upstream: https://github.com/Uniswap/v3-core
Proofs:   https://github.com/kbelludoo/lin-open
Clone:    https://github.com/kbelludoo/clone-lin-uniswap-v3-tick

See the GNU GPL version 2 or later for terms.
